{
  "description": "ProducersModule (vital/src/synthesis/modules/producers_module.cpp, sample_module.cpp): three oscillators and the sampler with their controls, every destination (filter 1/2, dual, effects, direct out, out of range) with the filters on (unplugged, as the module's own default, and plugged), the filter-on switches (params.filter1_on / filter2_on through setFilter1On / setFilter2On): each filter and both off for filter 1, filter 2 and dual routing, and switched off mid-run, FM/RM processing order across oscillators (including a dependency cycle, where upstream processes none of the three) and from the sample, the sample module with the default and a loaded sample and switched off (and back on) mid-run through params.control_changes, with its phase output captured as sample_phase, single-voice and block size. Constant pitch and unity sample playback ratio only (see the pending cases in LEDGER.md). Ported in port/crates/oscillators.",
